#: ../../source/tools/terminal.rst:2
msgid "Use the Integrated Terminal"
msgstr "使用集成终端"

#: ../../source/tools/terminal.rst:4
msgid ""
"The **Terminal** panel gives a session its own command prompt. Use it for"
" project checks, Godot headless commands, formatters, tests, and other "
"commands you would normally run from PowerShell."
msgstr "**Terminal** 面板为会话提供独立的命令提示符。你可以使用它运行项目检查、Godot 无头命令、格式化工具、测试以及通常会在 PowerShell 中运行的其他命令。"

#: ../../source/tools/terminal.rst:9
msgid "Start and manage a terminal"
msgstr "启动和管理终端"

#: ../../source/tools/terminal.rst:11
msgid "Open a **Terminal** tab from a dock."
msgstr "从停靠区打开 **Terminal** 标签页。"

#: ../../source/tools/terminal.rst:12
msgid "Wait for the terminal to start in the selected workspace."
msgstr "等待终端在选定工作区中启动。"

#: ../../source/tools/terminal.rst:13
msgid "Run a command and read its output."
msgstr "运行命令并阅读输出。"

#: ../../source/tools/terminal.rst:14
msgid ""
"Use **Stop terminal** when the process should end, or **Restart "
"terminal** when the shell is no longer responding."
msgstr "进程应结束时使用 **Stop terminal**；shell 不再响应时使用 **Restart terminal**。"

#: ../../source/tools/terminal.rst:17
msgid ""
"Terminal sessions are scoped to the current Studio session. When you "
"change sessions, Studio stops the previous session's terminal processes. "
"After a restart, start a new terminal and check its working directory "
"instead of assuming an old process continued."
msgstr "终端会话限定在当前 Studio 会话内。切换会话时，Studio 会停止上一个会话的终端进程。重启后请启动新的终端并检查工作目录，不要假设旧进程仍在继续。"

#: ../../source/tools/terminal.rst:23
msgid "Agent terminal actions"
msgstr "Agent 终端操作"

#: ../../source/tools/terminal.rst:25
msgid ""
"The agent can request a safe verification command, inspect a job's status"
" and output, cancel a long-running job, or request a general command when"
" the workflow allows it. A command may be paused for approval, especially"
" when it writes files, uses the network, or has a broader effect than a "
"read-only check."
msgstr "agent 可以请求安全验证命令、检查任务状态和输出、取消长时间运行的任务，或在工作流允许时请求普通命令。命令可能会暂停并等待审批，尤其是在它写入文件、使用网络或影响范围大于只读检查时。"

#: ../../source/tools/terminal.rst:32
msgid "Before approving a command"
msgstr "批准命令前"

#: ../../source/tools/terminal.rst:34
msgid ""
"Read the full command, working directory, environment, and expected "
"output. Watch for:"
msgstr "阅读完整命令、工作目录、环境和预期输出。注意："

#: ../../source/tools/terminal.rst:37
msgid "commands that delete or overwrite files;"
msgstr "删除或覆盖文件的命令；"

#: ../../source/tools/terminal.rst:38
msgid "package installation or network access;"
msgstr "安装软件包或访问网络；"

#: ../../source/tools/terminal.rst:39
msgid "commands that use a different directory than the selected workspace;"
msgstr "使用不同于所选工作区目录的命令；"

#: ../../source/tools/terminal.rst:40
msgid "scripts that hide additional commands;"
msgstr "隐藏额外命令的脚本；"

#: ../../source/tools/terminal.rst:41
msgid "credentials or tokens interpolated into the command line."
msgstr "插入命令行的凭据或 token。"

#: ../../source/tools/terminal.rst:43
msgid ""
"Prefer a named project verification preset when one exists. If no "
"validator exists, ask the agent to show the exact command and explain "
"what a passing result means."
msgstr "存在命名的项目验证预设时，优先使用它。如果没有验证器，请让 agent 显示确切命令，并解释通过结果意味着什么。"

#: ../../source/tools/terminal.rst:48
msgid "Terminal output in the timeline"
msgstr "时间线中的终端输出"

#: ../../source/tools/terminal.rst:50
msgid ""
"The conversation can show a command's progress, output tail, exit result,"
" and whether the command was cancelled. A green-looking completion "
"message is not enough: check the exit status and whether the command "
"actually tested the artifact that changed."
msgstr "对话可以显示命令进度、输出尾部、退出结果以及命令是否被取消。看起来绿色的完成消息还不够：请检查退出状态，以及命令是否确实测试了发生变更的产物。"
